<!--
  Sparkle-style appcast consumed by the `upgrader` package (UpgraderAppcastStore).
  The app reads it from Constants.appCastUrl, which points at the working branch
  of this fork - 'main' mirrors upstream and must stay clean.

  On every release: add an <item> (or bump the existing one) whose
  sparkle:version is the new version and whose enclosure url points at the
  installer asset uploaded to that GitHub release. Items without sparkle:os are
  offered on every platform, so drop the file into per-platform items as soon as
  more than one installer is published.
-->
