  <channel>
    <title>Hiddify</title>
    <link>https://github.com/xgs87762GH/hiddify-app</link>
    <description>Hiddify releases</description>
    <language>en</language>
    <item>
      <title>Version 5.0.5</title>
      <pubDate>Wed, 28 Oct 2026 14:31:00 +0800</pubDate>
      <description><![CDATA[
        <ul>
          <li>修复：连接状态不再卡在加载中，点击连接始终有响应、按钮不再显示空白转圈。</li>
          <li>修复：gRPC 通道改为复用，不再每次 resume/重连都重建，状态不再在「已断开/连接中」间乱跳。</li>
          <li>修复：抑制隧道启停途中一次性的 stopped 事件，连接中途按钮不再弹回「未连接」。</li>
          <li>修复：核心启动失败时镜像为 stopped，不再让界面永久卡在「连接中」。</li>
          <li>安装向导新增简体中文语言。</li>
        </ul>
      ]]></description>
      <sparkle:releaseNotesLink>
        https://github.com/xgs87762GH/hiddify-app/releases/tag/v5.0.5
      </sparkle:releaseNotesLink>
      <enclosure
        url="https://github.com/xgs87762GH/hiddify-app/releases/download/v5.0.5/hiddify-5.0.5+50005-windows-setup.exe"
        length="44349154"
        type="application/octet-stream"
        sparkle:version="5.0.5" />
    </item>
  </channel>
